        "Render a stable nine-cell board with X taking the first turn.",
        "An accepted move must mark exactly one empty cell and then alternate the active player.",
        "Selecting an occupied cell must not overwrite its mark or advance the turn.",
        "Derive the visible status from the board and active player rather than maintaining duplicate display state."
      ],
